### 1. WSDL
GET http://localhost:8080/ode/processes/EnrollmentService?wsdl

### 2. Nominal (350,000 FCFA)
POST http://localhost:8080/ode/processes/EnrollmentService
Content-Type: text/xml;charset=UTF-8
SOAPAction: "enroll"

<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:tns="http://tp.bpel/enrollment/">
    <soapenv:Header/>
    <soapenv:Body>
        <tns:enrollRequest>
            <student>Abraham Noumsi</student>
            <amount>350000</amount>
        </tns:enrollRequest>
    </soapenv:Body>
</soapenv:Envelope>

### 3. Refusal (900,000 FCFA)
